cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  CellRegBatch is a batch layer on top of CellReg. The registration method
  and most of the code are CellReg's. If you use this software, please cite
  the CellReg paper given under preferred-citation.
title: CellRegBatch
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Plusnin
    given-names: Viktor
    affiliation: >-
      Institute for Advanced Brain Studies, Lomonosov Moscow State University
repository-code: "https://github.com/iabs-neuro/CellRegBatch"
license: GPL-2.0-only
keywords:
  - calcium imaging
  - cell registration
  - neuron tracking
  - CellReg
  - MATLAB
references:
